// Where each federal institution is headquartered: `seed/federal-sites.tsv`,
// cell for cell. A row is keyed by the engine's institution id, so the map's
// office camera and the Washington tree find an office's point without the
// dataset reading the engine. A sourced row carries the record that says the
// institution is headquartered there and the record its coordinates were read
// from; a row with no location says why. A component housed in its parent's
// building is placed there only where a record says so, never by default.
/**
 * The fifteen executive departments, by the engine's institution id. The
 * validator holds every one of them to a sourced point, and the engine's own
 * test holds this list to its catalog's departments.
 */
